      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Abstract—Approaches for stochastic nonlinear model predic-",
      "bbox": [
        58.927001953125,
        177.80323791503906,
        300.0233154296875,
        185.86402893066406
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "tive control (SNMPC) typically make restrictive assumptions",
      "bbox": [
        48.96400451660156,
        187.76625061035156,
        300.0231628417969,
        195.82704162597656
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "about the system dynamics and rely on approximations to char-",
      "bbox": [
        48.96400451660156,
        197.7282257080078,
        300.023193359375,
        205.7890167236328
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "acterize the evolution of the underlying uncertainty distributions.",
      "bbox": [
        48.96400451660156,
        207.6912384033203,
        300.02313232421875,
        215.7520294189453
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "For this reason, they are often unable to capture more complex",
      "bbox": [
        48.96400451660156,
        217.6542510986328,
        300.023193359375,
        225.7150421142578
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "distributions (e.g., non-Gaussian or multi-modal) and cannot",
      "bbox": [
        48.96400451660156,
        227.61622619628906,
        300.0232238769531,
        235.67701721191406
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "provide accurate guarantees of performance. In this paper,",
      "bbox": [
        48.96400451660156,
        237.57923889160156,
        300.0231628417969,
        245.64002990722656
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "we present a sampling-based SNMPC approach that leverages",
      "bbox": [
        48.96400451660156,
        247.54225158691406,
        300.023193359375,
        255.60304260253906
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "recently derived sample complexity bounds to certify the perfor-",
      "bbox": [
        48.96400451660156,
        257.50421142578125,
        300.023193359375,
        265.56500244140625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "mance of a feedback policy without making assumptions about",
      "bbox": [
        48.96400451660156,
        267.46722412109375,
        300.023193359375,
        275.52801513671875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "the system dynamics or underlying uncertainty distributions. By",
      "bbox": [
        48.96400451660156,
        277.43023681640625,
        300.023193359375,
        285.49102783203125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "parallelizing our approach, we are able to demonstrate real-time",
      "bbox": [
        48.96400451660156,
        287.3922424316406,
        300.0231628417969,
        295.45306396484375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "receding-horizon SNMPC with statistical safety guarantees in",
      "bbox": [
        48.96400451660156,
        297.3552551269531,
        300.023193359375,
        305.41607666015625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "simulation and on hardware using a 1/10th scale rally car and a",
      "bbox": [
        48.96400451660156,
        303.5082702636719,
        300.0230712890625,
        315.3780517578125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "24-inch wingspan fixed-wing unmanned aerial vehicle (UAV).",
      "bbox": [
        48.96400451660156,
        317.2802734375,
        288.6448974609375,
        325.341064453125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Index Terms—Planning under Uncertainty, Integrated Plan-",
      "bbox": [
