    },
    {
      "text": "s/constraint of feedback policy distributions. We demonstrated our approach",
      "bbox": [
        311.9779968261719,
        379.4053039550781,
        563.0361938476562,
        386.5305480957031
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "on a 1/10th-scale Rally Car (a, b) and an Edge 540 fixed-wing UAV (c, d).",
      "bbox": [
        311.9779968261719,
        388.3713073730469,
        559.5691528320312,
        395.4965515136719
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "SNMPC, uncertainty distributions are often approximated via",
      "bbox": [
        311.9779968261719,
        401.6973876953125,
        563.0354614257812,
        410.60394287109375
      ],
      "direction": [
